        "active": true,
        "notes": "minimatch globparts DoS, fixed only in minimatch 11 (named-export API). The 10.x copies are overridden to 11.0.4. The 3.x copies are pinned by npm-run-all (script runner used by the npm start scripts only) and dotgitignore (standard-version); the 5.x copies by @redocly/openapi-core 1.34 (via @mojaloop/api-snippets) and filelist (jake, via shins). All of them call minimatch as a function and cannot take 11; lint, test, release and codegen tooling only, not reachable at runtime. Reassess when they move to minimatch 11.",
        "expiry": "2026-12-31"
      }
    }
  ]
